OL,3,GNEWSAFather of murdered man describes
OL,4,Atrial as 'hell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a man who was fatally
OL,7,Fattacked by an armed gang has described
OL,8,Fthe trial following his son's death as
OL,9,F"hell".
OL,11,FDale Martin, also known as DJ, was
OL,12,Fdragged out of a car in Derby in June
OL,13,F2025 and repeatedly stabbed and
OL,14,Fslashed.
OL,16,FOn Friday, one man was was given a life
OL,17,Fsentence, with a minimum term of 27
OL,18,Fyears, for his murder. Five other men
OL,19,Ffrom the city - who were found guilty
OL,20,Fof manslaughter following a trial more
OL,21,Fthan four months long - were also
OL,22,Fjailed.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
