OL,3,GNEWSAFather of murdered man describes
OL,4,Atrial as 'hell'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to the BBC after the
OL,7,Fsentencing hearing, the victim's
OL,8,Ffather, Dale Martin, said some of the
OL,9,Fkillers went to the same school as his
OL,10,Fson, and some would come to his house
OL,11,Ffor evening meals as children.
